<title>USA: Prince George's Cty, Md., keeps tax cap.</title>
<headline>Prince George's Cty, Md., keeps tax cap.</headline>
<dateline>UPPER MARLBORO, Md 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Prince George's County, Maryland, failed to repeal a cap on property taxes, a county election official said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The voters chose not to repeal the cap by 61-39 percent, with 119,054 people voting against the repeal and 76,325 voting for the repeal.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
</text>
